PROCESS_ID (255), STEP_ID (20), STEP_ID_MBR (declared by the template but not used here), EDL_RUN_ID, LOB, LOAD_LOG_KEY_TABLE, chartsMasterTable, deployTable, deployTempTable, targetTable, cplTargetTable, snow_flake_stage, s3_folder_path, TIMESTAMP_FOLDER, TIMESTAMP_DATE.

